# Shared calc.fdf template for this walkthrough. MD.TypeOfRun/MD.Steps
# here represent whatever relaxation you'd have used to converge
# initial.fdf/final.fdf in the first place (Section 2 of the README) --
# stb-neb overrides them unconditionally to a single-point evaluation in
# every image_NN/ it writes (config_extra.fdf, %include-d ahead of this
# file), so their VALUE here never actually matters to stb-neb itself.
# What DOES matter and is NOT overridden -- basis, k-grid, mesh cutoff,
# XC functional -- is deliberately kept IDENTICAL to whatever a real
# relaxation of initial.fdf/final.fdf would have used (Section 2.2).

SystemLabel      siesta
SystemName       siesta

%include structure.fdf

MD.TypeOfRun        CG
MD.Steps             100

PAO.BasisType       split
PAO.BasisSize       DZP
PAO.EnergyShift     0.02 Ry

kgrid.MonkhorstPack   [1  1  1]
Mesh.CutOff           200  Ry
FilterCutoff          150  Ry

XC.Functional       GGA
XC.Authors          PBE

Spin                non-polarized
